@PACKAGE_INIT@

# uniorm::uniorm is the whole of the consumer's link line. Backends are
# separate shared libraries under <libdir>/uniorm/backends/ and the core
# loads them by dlopen on scheme miss (see design.md §5.1); a consumer
# neither names them at link time nor selects them via COMPONENTS.
include("${CMAKE_CURRENT_LIST_DIR}/uniormTargets.cmake")
